        "输出未经上下文支持的售后答案"
      ]
    },
    {
      "case_id": "B014",
      "category": "ambiguous_emotional",
      "user_input": "退",
      "expected_action_type": "clarification",
      "retrieval_expected": false,
      "required_elements": [
        "询问用户是退货、退款还是其他诉求"
      ],
      "forbidden_elements": [
        "直接假设已要求退款",
        "承诺已经处理"
      ]
    },
    {
      "case_id": "B015",
      "category": "ambiguous_emotional",
      "user_input": "你们这鞋也太坑了吧，真给我气死了！",
